      "severity": "must",
      "text": "The restatement of `StepCase.of_checks` says “no unknown counter,” although an unknown counter outside `resolved.counterReads` still permits the `body` branch. Fix: Qualify both the premise and the counter-error branch to cover only the counters the statement reads, in read order."
